      "content": "SP 80 NE              THE LEE              KILN HILL                                            Swan Botton 1/108                                      Rabb's Corner - -                                          II Cottage.  C17.  Timber framed.  Partly brick cased, now wholly roughcast and colourwashed.  Old tile roof, two bays, one-and-a-half storeys. South gable stack flanked by lean-to porch and addition.  There light casements.  Two dormers.  One bay north addition. Listing NGR: SP8960405010"
    }
